        where to truncate
      * r, a *note rational number: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ,, nonnegative; the number
        whose truncation is to be computed
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, containing nonnegative rational
        numbers whose truncations are to be computed
  * Outputs:
      * t, a *note rational number: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ,, the e^{th} truncation of
        r (base p)
      * T, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, containing the e^{th} truncations
        (base p) of the elements of L

Description
===========

This function computes the $e^{th}$ truncation of the unique non-terminating
$p$-adic expansion of a positive rational number $r$.

+---------------------------------+
|i1 : adicTruncation(5, 2, 1/100) |
|                                 |
|o1 = 0                           |
|                                 |
|o1 : QQ                          |
+---------------------------------+
|i2 : adicTruncation(5, 4, 1/100) |
|                                 |
|      6                          |
|o2 = ---                         |
|     625                         |
|                                 |
|o2 : QQ                          |
+---------------------------------+
|i3 : adicTruncation(5, 5, 1/1000)|
|                                 |
|       3                         |
|o3 = ----                        |
|     3125                        |
|                                 |
|o3 : QQ                          |
+---------------------------------+

If $r = 0$, adicTruncation returns zero.

+----------------------------+
|i4 : adicTruncation(4, 2, 0)|
|                            |
|o4 = 0                      |
+----------------------------+

If a list $L$ of nonnegative rational numbers is passed, adicTruncation(p, e,
L) returns a list containing the $e^{th}$ truncations (base $p$) of those
numbers.

+------------------------------------------+
|i5 : adicTruncation(5, 5, {1/100, 1/1000})|
|                                          |
|       31     3                           |
|o5 = {----, ----}                         |
|      3125  3125                          |
|                                          |
|o5 : List                                 |
+------------------------------------------+

